@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam stateStartColor #163E52
skinparam stateEndColor #163E52
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title SM-M01 — Independent draft and live presentation context
state "Draft exists; no published\npresentation" as Draft
state "Live presentation and saved\ndraft aligned" as Aligned
state "Live unchanged; saved draft\nhas unapplied-to-live\nchanges" as Changed
[*] --> Draft : scoped initial context
Draft --> Draft : SM-T001 source edited\n[source edit only]\n\nSM-T002 apply selected / save\n[selected / current / saved]
Draft --> Aligned : SM-T003 publication confirmed\n[separate confirmed publish]
Aligned --> Changed : SM-T004 resume change saved\n[explicit / saved]
Changed --> Aligned : SM-T005 publication confirmed\n[separate confirmed publish]
Aligned --> Aligned : SM-T006 source edited\n[source edit only]
Changed --> Changed : SM-T007 source edited\n[source edit only]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
